Subject: desktop: start Baton (voice, injection report) and expose its renderer bridge

One call in DesktopApp after the IPC handlers, one call at the end of preload.ts; the work is in
apps/desktop/src/baton/. Baton's bridge is window.batonDesktopBridge, beside upstream's.

